description "Sio Bibble

A respectable gentleman who prefers governing over direct combat.

^2Weaponry:
- Unskilled Melee
-- 100% slower RoF
-- Punch/block only
- CR-2 Heavy Blaster Pistol (Red Saber)
-- No Block
-- No Saber Training
-- Chain Limit: 1
-- Staggers/trips/disarms on hit
-- 50% shorter
-- 33% thicker
- EC-17 Hold-Out Blaster Pistol (DC Carb 1)
-- 200% slower RoF
-- 400% slower reload
- Security Resolution (Minigun 3)
-- Tracks/poisons/drains on hit
-- Unblockable
-- Hitscan charges
-- 99% less damage
-- 3000% slower RoF

^5Powers:
- Protective Taxtation (2) ^7{Light's Beacon}

^6Inventory:
- Medpac
- Advanced Medpac
- Royal Naboo Sec. Force (Support Beacon) ^3[CS2]
- Seeker Drone ^3[CS4]
- Assault Sentry ^3[CS3]

^8Attributes:
- Naboo Palace Guard (Bodyguard)
- Healing (3)
- Recharge (2)
- 100% slower skill cooldown
- 40% less knockback given
- 25% more knockback taken
- No Gunbash
- No Pickups

^3Abilities:
- Dodge (3) ^3[CS1]"